    <string name="card_description_acrobat">Jumps in a straight line over an adjacent token. Can jump twice in a row.</string>
    <string name="card_description_leader">The game ends if a leader is captured or surrounded.\n\nA leader cannot end its action in a position where they would be captured.</string>
    <string name="card_description_rider">Move by two tiles in a straight line.</string>
    <string name="card_description_bruiser">Moves to an adjacent enemy’s space, pushing them to one of the opposite three spaces of your choice.</string>
    <string name="card_description_manipulator">Moves a non-adjacent enemy, visible in a straight line, by one space.</string>
    <string name="card_description_royal_guard">Moves from any space to a space adjacent to your Leader. May then move one additional space.</string>
    <string name="card_description_illusionist">Switches places with a non-adjacent, visible character in a straight line.</string>
    <string name="card_description_claw_launcher">Moves in a straight line all the way to a visible character, or drags them until they are adjacent.</string>
    <string name="card_description_brewmaster">Moves an adjacent ally one space.</string>
    <string name="card_description_wanderer">Moves to any space non-adjacent to an enemy.</string>
    <string name="card_description_archer">Can be two spaces in a straight line from the opponent’s Leader and help capture them. The Leader does not need to be visible.\\n\\nHowever, does not help capture the opponent’s Leader when adjacent.</string>
    <string name="card_description_assassin">Captures the opponent’s Leader when adjacent, even without a second ally.</string>
    <string name="card_description_jailer">Adjacent enemies with an active ability cannot use their ability.\n\nDoes not interrupt a in progress if the enemy becomes adjacent during the action.</string>
    <string name="card_description_protector">Enemy abilities may not move the Protector or any adjacent allies.</string>
    <string name="card_description_vizier">Your Leader may move one additional space during their action.</string>
    <string name="card_description_nemesis">Cannot take an action during their action phase. Must move by 2 tiles after any action moving the opponent’s Leader. If it is not possible to move by two tiles without going back to its original position, only moves by one tile.</string>
    <string name="card_description_hermit_and_cub">"When you recruit them, take both the Hermit and the Cub. These two characters count as one during the recruitment phase. You can move either the Hermit or the Cub, or one immediately after another. The cub cannot help capture the opponent’s Leader. "</string>
